ent-SunriseClothingEyesHudMedicalVirology = medical virology hud
    .desc = A medical heads-up display with a built-in contamination scanner. Shows the crew's health and highlights contaminated items nearby.
ent-SunriseClothingMaskSterileAdvanced = filtering sterile mask
    .desc = A tight-fitting sterile mask with a pale green filter layer.
ent-SunriseClothingHandsGlovesVirology = virology gloves
    .desc = Thick teal gloves with a glossy antiseptic coating and reinforced cuffs.
ent-SunriseClothingOuterBioVirologyAdvanced = sealed bio suit
    .desc = A sealed, positive-pressure bio suit in bright white with teal panels.
    .suffix = Virology
ent-SunriseClothingHeadHatHoodBioVirologyAdvanced = sealed bio hood
    .desc = A sealed hood with a wide teal-tinted filtered visor.
    .suffix = Virology
ent-SunriseDiseaseSprayerLarge = large disinfectant sprayer
    .desc = A large pressurized sprayer for disinfectant. Holds enough to treat a whole ward.
    .suffix = Empty
ent-SunriseDisinfectantGrenade = disinfectant grenade
    .desc = A canister of aerosolised disinfectant. Kills the contagion on contaminated items and on the dead in a wide radius.
ent-SunriseDisinfectantMist = disinfectant mist
    .desc = A fine mist of disinfectant settling down.
ent-SunriseDiseaseVaccineInjector = vaccine injector
    .desc = A reusable pneumatic injector. Load a vaccine and it will dose the crew one after another without using the vaccine up.
ent-SunriseDiseaseSterilizerArch = sterilizer arch
    .desc = A walk-through arch that sprays everyone passing under it with disinfectant and beeps at the infected. Kills the contagion on carried items and on the dead, but cannot cure the living.
ent-SunriseDiseaseSterilizerCircuitboard = sterilizer arch machine board
    .desc = A machine printed circuit board for a sterilizer arch.
